/* Per-school detail, loaded only by school.html.

   The schedule is stated in three tables so that nothing is said twice. VENUES is
   the list of places, geocoded once each. MEETS is keyed by the meet's own TFRRS
   id — two different meets can share a name, so a name is not a key — and points
   at a venue by index. SCHED lists, per school, the ids of the meets its own TFRRS
   results page shows it at, in date order.

   Every meet here was read off its own results page, so the venue is that year's
   venue even for a championship whose host rotates, and the season letter comes off
   the events that page links rather than off the date. 1,025 of 1,027 meets are
   placed; the two that are not printed no venue at all. */

